  "summary": "C8 loads the region (lat 60.10\u201361.28, lon 20.02\u201321.20) for every day from 1991-12-27 to 2003-08-31 into /tmp/sst.npy. C9 reads that file back, builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day baseline pools, smooths them with a wrapping 31-day mean, and compares target-day SST (2003-06-01 to 2003-08-31) against them. Only the smoothed thresholds for day-of-year 153\u2013244 are used, which draw on pools for days 138\u2013259, so each baseline year contributes May 12 to Sep 20; the climatology is unused."
